# Prototype patch: EAGLE-3 draft models with recurrent (Mamba2) layers in vLLM 0.25.1
#
# Apply with: patch -p1 -d $VLLM_DIR < this-file   (see README.md)
#
# 1) The drafting loop builds its own CommonAttentionMetadata and never supplied
#    is_prefilling / seq_lens_cpu_upper_bound, both asserted by the Mamba builder.
#    Inside the multi-step loop every request advances exactly one token, so
#    is_prefilling is all-False there.
# 2) Mamba's full-CUDAGraph capture asserted a single decode shape
#    (1 + num_spec_tokens, the target's verify pass). A draft capturing its own
#    loop has uniform query_len 1, which is equally decode-only.

